Subject: [PATCH 3/6] test(app): fig8 Outside full-width reading moves to the
 one ring set

Outside now walks the offsets of the part. At the fig8 waist the rings
of the two lobes merge and 495 points take the full tool width, all in
the waist band (Inside on the same set reads 10686). The pin holds the
rest of the band at none; #3788 cuts the merge.

Refs #3744

