From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:48:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix(2d): name each full-width cut of a start-side plan by
 the flanks law

order() now judges a full-width cut by the law of the full-width meter:
both flank points, 0.9 tool radii either side of the walk, stand in
uncut material. The fig8 waist cuts of the one ring set (Outside 495
meter points, 14 cuts) are named on the path now; before, the narrow
note said nothing. Inside names its waist cuts the same way.

Refs #3744
Refs #3788

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
